            "notes": "Again, play as you would in competitive.\n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is the best and usual buy. If you don't have enough money, [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is also good.\n\nIf the enemy team has too much damage for you to handle, [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) and [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) can help.\n\nOnly worth sell is [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418). [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) should not be sold unless needed or for better slot efficiency.",
