            "notes": "If you are very ahead, buy [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) to press the lead.\nIf you struggling to stay alive, buy [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) if you can.\n\nIf none of the above are true, buy [Ice Sheet](item_6dd4ada0-3a27-4e54-b321-d67a1bf5790e) and use your walls as cover, healing and disruption, all at the same time.\n\nIf you are keeping track of cooldowns and ultimates (**AS YOU SHOULD!!!!!**), use your wall to block them if possible.",
