            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-10-03T04:10:46.017987+00:00",
            "notes": "From now on now, you are basically unkillable unless you position poorly or the enemies have BIG damage and/or anti-healing, like [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546), [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) and [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed). \n\nFrom this round onwards, your playstyle is: stay with your team, don't die and make the enemies waste resources and time trying to kill you. There is no need to try flanking or taking random 1v1s, as you should win basically every battle of attrition. Use your walls as cover and healing, run around your pillars to avoid getting shot, hit icicles and slow your enemies down so your team's actual dps can delete them.\n\nIf possible, sell [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) or [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214), as they often give more value.",
