            "notes": "Sell [Ice Sheet](item_6dd4ada0-3a27-4e54-b321-d67a1bf5790e) for [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) if possible.\n\nSell [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) for [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) if possible.\n\nPlease don't try taking 1v1's from now on. You WILL NOT win unless you outskill them, and even then you may lose, depending on matchup. There is no need to flip the game in ego fights. Remember: you are playing Fortnite Mei. The last one standing wins.",
