            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-10-03T04:10:46.017987+00:00",
            "notes": "More utility focused playstyle when compared to before. Stay with your team, keep the overtimes rolling, use walls as cover and healing, summon pillars to be annoying, click [Blizzard](ability_71721494-1f55-4f3e-a8b9-ac3d0c38ddae) every time it is up.\n\nYou goal here is to just be an enabler to your team. [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) are your damage core, but they will **NOT** make you an actual killing threat, just one that enemies can't ignore and that can finish off strugglers if needed.  \n\nThe rest of your inventory should be focused on survival, as your biggest impact is staying alive to keep contesting objective and using blizzard to make easy targets. Your damage is negligible but your slows are very useful from now on, as everyone does so much damage, so you should be only using primary fire.",
